VwR_tIoHguUQ7kNvwG44JFU&_nc_oc=AdqLCUWtqdwFe5uMo1tk79awUAj_2ceMjh_zLkp1TInN7I7oLi62PdRzu_-FFBqzvk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIunJlMc7wXoA1ql7z4Xoha_Cw2wh9IPHMy_Cyc8iRTsg&oe=6AAAA437"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=332UdgBIQ14Q7kNvwFgMdnu&_nc_oc=AdpySGCdZ2wV5M7HVcSpApvJS007pD2tcj7e70QIAgGToZOxAzJTWfYcn6CNQHjbbgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIF4lAuNesFyFZfOfJJCExK9X448mJ8vSlQl1vdxFtqNQ&oe=6AAAA5CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D1Wm-WPD8V4Q7kNvwEPnF-c&_nc_oc=AdpOKywx2b1TxLe3bpJF3o5PsXQdXSNDSUM5aDC-Jlhsm8pUSUkz1fMpNugUFkJ61lI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQEzRF2ZSNiQ5lZahteoAFrRyznZ1NNmE7HLhEZtRGTQ&oe=6AAA92EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oDDM5QiSaHkQ7kNvwEprQfw&_nc_oc=AdpVjVMV3_Hi8GExmPu_iMyoJQNelB9edt1NfxzyoyzeZkxMPKg6tPzYIl_FOJHLqVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJejiVRkY5w9S81gU-IiiJ1O0DedOQhAbR68AEEQX_VfA&oe=6AAAB483"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=09DrXZ8PScMQ7kNvwGGMlsX&_nc_oc=Adr04EAeI9Xs0O_rCD6mMWxT-bsHoaYIoEKOReblJxY3zEs--GMc8MpmsxBKKymExbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQlOk6-0sFhShD0nPgYbRpwfMk6-idcsOZIBYS76xzRg&oe=6AAAACD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NKUsFH325vMQ7kNvwFGLyRe&_nc_oc=AdraZADJ4dfJKNPmJM6I9lSxcOu8lPPPbkd2eo0c8F8F2xT7xoSOxxahDn1QthFKuIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKuXCwHnwleP-6f9WyiBWlb27Qb4ycnS15xqpYL2Rrriw&oe=6AAA87BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080